/* ---------- AI ROLES ---------- */
const R12=[['Thinking partner','Brainstorm ideas, explore perspectives, and sharpen your thinking.','Let\'s think through [topic] together. Ask me one question at a time, offer angles I haven\'t considered, and push back where my reasoning is thin.'],
 ['Researcher','Find facts, insights, examples and deep information, faster.','Research [question]. Give the key facts with sources, note where sources disagree, and flag what is uncertain or out of date.'],
 ['Simulator','Rehearse scenarios, practice conversations, and prepare for real situations.','Play [person/role] in [scenario]. Stay in character and react realistically. After 5 exchanges, step out and give me feedback on how I did.'],
 ['Critic','Give and receive honest feedback. Challenge weak points and blind spots.','Critique this [draft/plan] as a tough but fair reviewer. List the 5 weakest points and the blind spots, and say what would make it clearly stronger.'],
 ['Reverse engineer','Work backward from goals. Understand how things work.','My goal is [outcome] by [date]. Work backward: what must be true just before that, and before that, down to what I should do this week?'],
 ['Decision lab','Compare options, weigh pros and cons, and stress-test your choices.','Compare [option A] vs [option B] on [criteria]. Run a pre-mortem on each, and tell me what new information would change the answer.'],
 ['Pattern finder','Spot trends, recurring behaviors and hidden patterns in data or situations.','Here is [data/notes/log]. Find recurring trends, anomalies and hidden patterns, and show the evidence for each one.'],
 ['Problem decomposer','Break big, messy problems into smaller, clear, actionable parts.','Break [big messy problem] into smaller, clear, actionable parts, with an order, dependencies and a first step I can do today.'],
 ['Assumption tester','Question assumptions, identify risks, and test what you believe to be true.','List the assumptions behind [plan/belief], rate how risky each one is, and suggest the cheapest way to test the riskiest.'],
 ['Personal tutor','Explain concepts, teach step by step, quiz you and adapt to your level.','Teach me [concept] step by step at a [beginner/intermediate] level. After each step, ask me a question to check understanding and adapt.'],
 ['Editor','Improve your writing, structure, tone and clarity.','Edit this for clarity, structure and tone for [audience]. Keep my voice. List the main changes and why you made them.'],
 ['Systems designer','Design workflows, systems and processes that save time and create results.','Act as a systems designer. My goal is [outcome]. Ask clarifying questions, then design a repeatable step-by-step system with templates, bottlenecks and metrics.']];
